msgid ""
"Elegimos cada producto porque suena bien y cuesta lo justo. Si no sabes cuál"
" instrumento te conviene, escríbenos o agenda una cita y te ayudamos a "
"decidir."
msgstr ""
"We choose each product because it sounds good and costs a fair price. If you"
" are not sure which instrument suits you, write to us or book an appointment"
" and we will help you decide."

