msgid ""
"Trae tu instrumento y lo dejamos listo para tocar. Atendemos de lunes a "
"sábado, de 10:00 a 18:00."
msgstr ""
"Bring your instrument and we will get it ready to play. We are open Monday "
"to Saturday, from 10:00 to 18:00."

